      "downloads": 7714,
      "favourites_count": 15,
      "description": "<p>This is an updated version of <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1267/peacemaker\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Choccy’s Peacemaker</a>.</p>\n<p>All I did was rewrite the server mod for SPT 4.0, roughly mirroring the original code.</p>\n<p>The bundles remain unchanged from the 3.11 (1.0.10) release zip and I might not be able to update them if they break with a future game update.</p>\n<p>Model is <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.cgtrader.com/free-3d-models/military/gun/revolver-colt-1873\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Revolver Colt 1873</a> by <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.cgtrader.com/designers/sinki1295\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">sinki1295</a></p>\n<p>Animations and original code by Choccy</p>\n",
